          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-10-06 · Home catches up with the code (UI-79): the curated «Destacados», the four categories by type and the door in the hero are gone; Home is the library of the 53 bases with a search by name, the rooms as chips with a count, sizes in cm as width × depth × height, the band «¿No está el tuyo?» after the list and a floating «Diseña el tuyo». Redrawn at the app's sizes on both bases: Library, End of the list (replaces «Catalog first, expert connected») and Room chosen (replaces «Category, few bases»); new on mobile, Room chosen and No base matches. The thumbnails are the app's own sketches (assets/capture/home-base-*.png). The five desktop Connect dialogs sit over the new Home. The form's no-expert callout carries a primary «Conectar experto» and «Ver bases» in place of «Probar con los ejemplos simulados», and the eight Connect dialogs lose that button (D58: «Usar el experto simulado» shows only with the debug access, not drawn). Kit gap noted: the kit's Chip has no count and is 36 px; Home's is 44 px with a count, drawn locally · UI-79",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tp99g",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$graphite",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-10-02 · Home / Connect the expert: the three states the first draft lacked, desktop and mobile — OpenAI chosen (the «Modelo» field, because that provider has no suggested model, and the key placeholder «sk-…»), SheLLM chosen (its block: what it is, «Dirección», the origin to copy; the key becomes optional and the main button «Conectar» is enabled) and saved keys waiting (the rust warning «Al conectar con una llave nueva se borran las guardadas» with «Volver a mis llaves»). The dialog that outgrows 92 % of the window scrolls its body under a fixed footer, as in the code; on the phone the warning and its link are two lines because Pencil has one text style per text",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
