          "type": "text",
          "id": "bRldi",
          "name": "Entry",
          "fill": "$graphite",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-10-02 · Base / Adjust your base (desktop, proposal): redrawn at the code's sizes — 36 px of side padding, the form scrolls over a fixed footer, title 36, questions 24, text 16, fields 48 and the 56 px main button; the finish question is below the 900 px fold, as in the app (UI-61). The mobile one is unchanged · UI-61",
