          "fill": "$graphite",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-10-02 · kit 0.4.0 · re-vendored: focus and on-rust tokens, rust and paper values, 44 px buttons, Button/Disabled in place of the dimmed instances, RadioCard, FinishSelect and TraceLog added; the saved-keys dialog gains \"Olvidé la frase\", the chosen provider card has a graphite border and its description indented, the finish select is the kit component. Known drift left: the desktop Adjust your base is drawn with the mobile type sizes (30 / 19 / 14 against 36 / 24 / 16) · UI-40, UI-45, UI-46, UI-47, UI-53, UI-54",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
