          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-09-30 · the mobile section follows the desktop flow in five steps (Home, Adjust your base, Connect the expert, Describe your furniture, Analyzing) with Adrian's choices: a compact door under the headline, the description first, the 3D on top in the base step; removed what they replace (the app's Home, the old proposal, the old empty, no-expert and filled entries, the missing-key screen and the old Analyzing); the states still valid wait in a side column to be redrawn · UI-29, UI-31, UI-32, UI-35",
