          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "These states are still drawn in the old shell and wait to be redrawn in the new one (the column \"States to redraw in the new shell\" and the \"To review\" column). kit-version-source: 0.3.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\nStates of the one screen; each starts from the filled screen and sits under its step: 3 · Filling in (view menu, reading failed, note, five photos, kind changed) and 4 · Sending (missing key, design failed).\n3. SCREENS\n- Photo reading failed: the tag reads \"¿Qué vista?\" and the person picks it; no retry (the photo is still sent)\n- Choosing a photo's view: the tag opens a menu — Frente, 3/4, Lateral, Interior, Uniones; the chosen one in amber-soft (selection, K6)\n- Five photos, the limit: the add tile disappears; \"5 de 5\" next to \"Fotos\"\n- Design failed, retry: reconstructFailed() above the actions, with \"Reintentar\" and \"Ver qué pasó\" (src/application/useCases/copy.ts)\n- Missing API key: missing() (src/ports/Preferences.ts) + \"Configurar\", neutral (K6); \"Analizar\" disabled\n- Writing a photo note: the note opens under its photo as a TextArea with focus\n- Kind changed, measures kept: measures the person touched stay; untouched ones re-fill with the new kind's typical\nKIT GAPS\nrust-soft (the error box is bg-rust/10 in code) · Field (0.3.0)\nNEW COPY\n\"¿Qué vista?\", \"5 de 5\", \"Son tus medidas: se quedan aunque cambies el tipo.\"",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
